[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m Substituting \(z = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 117i\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta - 117\sin\theta) = 4((75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \]
