[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4} = \frac{96\cos\theta + 144i\cos\theta - 96i\sin\theta - 144\sin\theta}{4} = \frac{(96\cos\theta - 144\sin\theta) + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4}
