[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta} = \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4(\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta)} = \frac{(96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta) + i(144\cos\theta - 96\sin\theta)}{4} = 24(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + 36i(\sin\theta - \cos\theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \]
