[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to maximize the real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(|z| = 4\). Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m Substituting \(z = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i) \cdot 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m And,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos \theta - i \sin \theta}{\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta} = (24 - 36i)(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = 24 \cos \theta + 36 \sin \theta - i(24 \sin \theta - 36 \cos \theta).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m Combining these, the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=119614)[0m \[
